<div class="shift_text">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section_heading">
      <h2>Shift in Cooking Culture</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="shift_info">
      <ul>
        <li>Indian kitchens have seen quiet revolutions from brass to cast iron, steel to aluminum, and finally, to non-stick. It promised ease, and it delivered. But at what cost?</li>
        <li>Chipped coatings, chemical leaching, and surfaces that gave up too soon made us question the tools we trust</li>
        <li>Now, we believe love deserves better. Because when meals are made with care, cookware should carry the same intention</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
